music.mp3<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Happy Birthday Gaytri ❤️</title>

<style>
*{
margin:0;
padding:0;
box-sizing:border-box;
font-family:Arial,sans-serif;
}

body{
background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ff6ec4,#7873f5);
color:white;
text-align:center;
overflow-x:hidden;
}

.hero{
padding:80px 20px;
}

.hero h1{
font-size:3rem;
animation:glow 2s infinite alternate;
}

@keyframes glow{
from{ text-shadow:0 0 10px #fff;}
to{ text-shadow:0 0 30px #ff1493;}
}

.hero p{
max-width:700px;
margin:20px auto;
font-size:1.2rem;
line-height:1.8;
}

.gallery{
display:flex;
justify-content:center;
gap:20px;
flex-wrap:wrap;
padding:40px 20px;
}

.card{
background:rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
padding:15px;
border-radius:20px;
backdrop-filter:blur(10px);
}

.card img{
width:250px;
height:320px;
object-fit:cover;
border-radius:15px;
border:3px solid white;
}

.card h3{
margin-top:10px;
}

.cake-section{
padding:40px;
}

.flame{
font-size:50px;
animation:flicker .5s infinite alternate;
}

@keyframes flicker{
from{transform:translateY(0);}
to{transform:translateY(-5px);}
}

.cake{
font-size:140px;
}

button{
padding:15px 35px;
font-size:18px;
border:none;
border-radius:40px;
background:white;
color:#ff1493;
font-weight:bold;
cursor:pointer;
margin-top:20px;
}

.hidden{
display:none;
}

#letter{
max-width:800px;
margin:40px auto;
padding:30px;
background:rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
border-radius:20px;
line-height:1.8;
font-size:1.2rem;
}

.heart{
position:fixed;
font-size:25px;
pointer-events:none;
animation:float 6s linear forwards;
}

@keyframes float{
from{
transform:translateY(100vh);
opacity:1;
}
to{
transform:translateY(-100px);
opacity:0;
}
}

.confetti{
position:fixed;
width:10px;
height:10px;
top:-10px;
animation:fall linear forwards;
}

@keyframes fall{
to{
transform:translateY(110vh) rotate(720deg);
}
}

.footer{
padding:40px;
font-size:1.4rem;
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="hero">
<h1>🎂 Happy Birthday Gaytri ❤️</h1>

<p>
From your cute childhood memories 🌸
to the wonderful person you are today ✨
you have always been special.

May your life be filled with happiness,
success, laughter and beautiful memories.

Wishing you a day full of smiles and joy ❤️
</p>
</div>

<h2>🌸 Gaytri's Beautiful Journey 🌸</h2>

<div class="gallery">

<div class="card">
<img src="g1.jpg">
<h3>Little Princess 👑</h3>
</div>

<div class="card">
<img src="g2.jpg">
<h3>Growing Beautiful 🌷</h3>
</div>

<div class="card">
<img src="g3.jpg">
<h3>The Amazing Gaytri ❤️</h3>
</div>

</div>

<div class="cake-section">

<div id="flame" class="flame">🕯️</div>

<div class="cake">🎂</div>

<button onclick="blowCandle()">
💨 Blow Candle
</button>

</div>

<div id="letter" class="hidden">

<h2>💌 Dear Gaytri 💌</h2>

<p>

Every photo tells a story,
every smile spreads happiness,
and every moment becomes beautiful.

May all your dreams come true.
May success always walk beside you.
May happiness never leave your side.

You deserve all the love,
all the joy,
and all the beautiful things in life.

❤️ Happy Birthday Gaytri ❤️

</p>

</div>

<div class="footer">
🌹 You Are Truly Special 🌹
</div>

<script>

setInterval(()=>{

let h=document.createElement("div");

h.innerHTML="❤️";

h.className="heart";

h.style.left=Math.random()*100+"vw";

document.body.appendChild(h);

setTimeout(()=>{
h.remove();
},6000);

},400);

function blowCandle(){

document.getElementById("flame").style.display="none";

document.getElementById("letter")
.classList.remove("hidden");

for(let i=0;i<250;i++){

let c=document.createElement("div");

c.className="confetti";

c.style.left=Math.random()*100+"vw";

c.style.background=
`hsl(${Math.random()*360},100%,50%)`;

c.style.animationDuration=
(2+Math.random()*3)+"s";

document.body.appendChild(c);

setTimeout(()=>{
c.remove();
},6000);
}

}

</script>

</body>
</html>
